					<div class="col-sm-9">
						<h4>Jenny 1.5 Horse Power 1 Phase 30 Gallon Air Compressor - K15A-30-1</h4>
						<p>
							The Jenny K15A is a great entry level stationary compressor. This is a similar compressor the the Jenny
							K15A-8P wheelbarrow machine. It is ideal for the extreme do it yourself homeowners as well as small machine and
							repair shops who need a professional unit at a smaller price than comparable manufacturers. This unit will be
							able to run virtually all air tools that you can throw its way.
						</p>
