					<div class="col-sm-9">
						<h4>Jenny 5 Horse Power 1 Phase 80 Gallon Compressor- GT5B-80-1</h4>
						<p>
							This 5 horse power stationary air compressor is one of Jenny's most popular compressors. It is known
							throughout the industry as being top of the line when it comes to both performance and power. Running off of a
							230V current, it is widely used in auto shops and other buildings where compressed air is a requirement. Also
							included is a limited 2-year warranty and comes filled with Jenny Synthetic Blue compressor pump oil.
						</p>
